(6010825, 881654, 114225, '<td valign="top">Looks like he has L series shoes :-)<br/>I like the overall idea. It took me a while to actually see what was going on, I think because the bride and priest are wearing the same color, they blend together a bit. I''m really not sure what could be done about that.</td>', 'Looks like he has L series shoes :-)I like the overall idea. It took me a while to actually see what was going on, I think because the bride and priest are wearing the same color, they blend together a bit. I''m really not sure what could be done about that.', '2010-05-17 08:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
