(6010841, 882112, 114225, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, up close for a camera bag doesn''t work for me. I think it''s because of the harsh patterns the material makes.</td>', 'Unfortunately, up close for a camera bag doesn''t work for me. I think it''s because of the harsh patterns the material makes.', '2010-05-17 09:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
