(6010853, 882184, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fun idea. It feels that there is a good amount of noise here, and that the color is off. I think if those two things were changed, I would have liked it even more.</td>', 'Fun idea. It feels that there is a good amount of noise here, and that the color is off. I think if those two things were changed, I would have liked it even more.', '2010-05-17 09:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
