(6011562, 882025, 61961, '<td valign="top">Outstanding.  This just blows me away.  The illusion couldn''t be better. Nice light, clarity, etc., and I like that the sky is ominous without being apocalyptic.  As a nitpick I might have your model do something more interesting (whatever that would be), but as is she certainly conveys the spirit of the image.</td>', 'Outstanding.  This just blows me away.  The illusion couldn''t be better. Nice light, clarity, etc., and I like that the sky is ominous without being apocalyptic.  As a nitpick I might have your model do something more interesting (whatever that would be), but as is she certainly conveys the spirit of the image.', '2010-05-17 16:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
