(6023684, 881476, 7889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by basssman7:</b></div><hr/><i> Great effort and a nice image.  However I just see way to many of these images.  Mount the camera on a pod in or outside of the vehicle and head down the highway snapping away.  The image would normally be an 8, but for lack of originality it is now a 5. sorry. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think that is a bit harsh Ernie, especially considering 3 of your top scores fall into the ''not original'' bracket<br/> <br/> ;-)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by basssman7: Great effort and a nice image.  However I just see way to many of these images.  Mount the camera on a pod in or outside of the vehicle and head down the highway snapping away.  The image would normally be an 8, but for lack of originality it is now a 5. sorry.   I think that is a bit harsh Ernie, especially considering 3 of your top scores fall into the ''not original'' bracket  ;-) ', '2010-05-24 06:59:58.000000', NULL, 0),
