(6023719, 881227, 106349, '<td valign="top">Great picture of your son Andrew (and I love your camera bag, too). Congrats on your top 10.</td>', 'Great picture of your son Andrew (and I love your camera bag, too). Congrats on your top 10.', '2010-05-24 08:17:47.000000', NULL, 0),
