(6028470, 881497, 86322, '<td valign="top">Another one of the many underrated photos.. This was a very original and funny photo. Far from the rest of us that just tried to be literal with the challenge and use a common bag. The lighting is superb, the composition is great, sharpness, etc. It is an interesting photo that should have been far from the 5.5 that it finished at. Great Job Tom.</td>', 'Another one of the many underrated photos.. This was a very original and funny photo. Far from the rest of us that just tried to be literal with the challenge and use a common bag. The lighting is superb, the composition is great, sharpness, etc. It is an interesting photo that should have been far from the 5.5 that it finished at. Great Job Tom.', '2010-05-26 13:02:32.000000', NULL, 0),
