(6028605, 881476, 92577, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by troysmith80:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice shot<br/> <br/>I believe the car is a Citroen C4 Picasso, is that right?<br/>citroen.co.uk/new-cars/citroen-c4-picasso/media-gallery/picture-gallery/exterior/ </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s a Citroen C4 Grand Picasso. (The "Grand" part alters the shape of the back end and makes it a 7 seater.)</td>', 'Originally posted by troysmith80: Nice shot I believe the car is a Citroen C4 Picasso, is that right?citroen.co.uk/new-cars/citroen-c4-picasso/media-gallery/picture-gallery/exterior/   It''s a Citroen C4 Grand Picasso. (The "Grand" part alters the shape of the back end and makes it a 7 seater.)', '2010-05-26 14:20:01.000000', NULL, 0),
