(6029745, 881952, 17507, '<td valign="top">Gee, nobody commented on this image? Well, shucks.<br/> <br/>At first I thought this image was nothing special: a camera bag on a diving board. So what?<br/> <br/>But then I saw the floating camera. Very nice touch--something that the speed voters may have missed.<br/> <br/>I gave this a 6. I definitely think it deserved better than the score it got.</td>', 'Gee, nobody commented on this image? Well, shucks. At first I thought this image was nothing special: a camera bag on a diving board. So what? But then I saw the floating camera. Very nice touch--something that the speed voters may have missed. I gave this a 6. I definitely think it deserved better than the score it got.', '2010-05-27 13:05:04.000000', NULL, 0),
