(7664847, 882274, 67145, '<td valign="top">i looked forever to find a good camera bag that wasnt too heavy and was relatively small .. <br/>but when i came on the high sierra backpack i found it the best one out of many i''d tried .. i have been using one now as a handbag for several years .. it fits my canon 5D series in it with batteries etc .. and a small lens ..  <br/>but putting the external flash in too was a bit to much . <br/> <br/>when i got into the olympus mirrorless .. the size of that camera was a godsend .. i could fit the camera, and an extra lens or even two .. depending on the size ... and the external flash .. all in my ''handbag'' .. <br/> <br/>if i was doing a paid gig i''d use other camera bags .. but day to day .. i like to travel as light as possible ... so the olympus was wonderful .. might sacrifice a bit of quality from the full frame ...<br/> <br/>i just went to see if the one i use is still available .. and like i said .. i''ve been using one for several years .. at least 10 or 12 or even more .. and they are still available .. was such a good design i''m not surprised ..  <br/><a href="https://www.highsierra.com.au/index.php/backpacks/mini-backapck.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">check it out .. </a></td>', 'i looked forever to find a good camera bag that wasnt too heavy and was relatively small .. but when i came on the high sierra backpack i found it the best one out of many i''d tried .. i have been using one now as a handbag for several years .. it fits my canon 5D series in it with batteries etc .. and a small lens ..  but putting the external flash in too was a bit to much .  when i got into the olympus mirrorless .. the size of that camera was a godsend .. i could fit the camera, and an extra lens or even two .. depending on the size ... and the external flash .. all in my ''handbag'' ..  if i was doing a paid gig i''d use other camera bags .. but day to day .. i like to travel as light as possible ... so the olympus was wonderful .. might sacrifice a bit of quality from the full frame ... i just went to see if the one i use is still available .. and like i said .. i''ve been using one for several years .. at least 10 or 12 or even more .. and they are still available .. was such a good design i''m not surprised ..  check it out .. ', '2020-06-01 22:04:57.000000', NULL, 0);
